{"hw":"τελευτάω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">τελευτάω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">τελευτ-άω</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">fut.</span> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <span class=\"gk\">-ήσω</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Tr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1029</span> </span>, etc.: <span class=\"lex-gram\">pf.</span> <span class=\"gk\">τετελεύτηκα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Men.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">75e</span> </span>, al.:—<span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Pass.</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">fut.</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Med.</span> </span> <span class=\"gk\">τελευτήσομαι</span> always in pass. sense, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">13.100</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Od.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8.510</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9.511</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Hipp.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">370</span> </span> (lyr.): <span class=\"lex-gram\">aor.</span> <span class=\"gk\">ἐτελευτήθην</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">15.74</span> </span>:—<b class=\"lex-tr\">bring to pass, accomplish</b>, <span class=\"gk\">ὄφρα.. τελευτήσω τάδε ἔργα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8.9</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τ. ἃ μενοινᾷς</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Od.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.275</span> </spa