</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἐπαίνου τ. ἐς τάδε ἔπη</span> ib.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">104</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"4\"><span class=\"lex-n\">b</span> freq. abs., <b class=\"lex-tr\">end life, die</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.66</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.38</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">40</span> </span>, al., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">R.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">614b</span> </span>, al.; <span class=\"gk\">πρὶν τελευτήσαντ' ἴδῃς</span> before you see him <b class=\"lex-tr\">dead</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Fr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">662</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τ. μάχῃ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Th.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">617</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">νούσῳ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.161</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">γήραϊ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.24</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τ. ὑπό τινος</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">die</b> by another's hand or means, ib.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">92</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">δόλῳ ὑπό τινος</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.78</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ὑπὸ αἰχμῆς σιδηρέης</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.39</span> </span>; <span clas