span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">32</span> </span>, etc.: of actions, events, etc., <span class=\"gk\">τ. ἡ ναυμαχία ἐς νύκτα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.51</span> </span>, etc. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"4\"><span class=\"lex-n\">b</span> with words indicating the kind of end or outcome, <span class=\"gk\">ἢν ὁ πόλεμος κατὰ νόον τ</span>. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9.45</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.47</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">εὖ τ</span>. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Supp.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">211</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">πτωχοὶ τ</span>. <b class=\"lex-tr\">end by being</b> beggars, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">R.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">552c</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">οὕτως τ</span>. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.110</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">138</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τ. ἔς τι</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">come to a</b> certain <b class=\"lex-tr\">end, issue in</b>, <span class=\"gk\">αἱ εὐτυχίαι ἐς τοῦτο ἐτελεύτησαν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.125</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τ. ἐς τὠυτὸ γράμμα</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">end in</b> the same letter, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.139</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.51</span> </span>, <span class=\