h with, at the end, at last</b>, as <span class=\"gk\">τελευτῶν ἔλεγε</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.75</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">κἂν ἐγίγνετο πληγὴ τελευτῶσα</span> there would have been a fray <b class=\"lex-tr\">to finish with</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ant.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">261</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τελευτῶν.. ἐξεβλήθη</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Eq.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">524</span> </span> (anap.); <span class=\"gk\">τὰς ὀλοφύρσεις τελευτῶντες ἐξέκαμνον</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">at last</b> they got tired of mourning, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.51</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">47</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἢν δέῃ τελευτῶντα τὴν στρωμνὴν ἐξαργυρῶσαι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8.81</span> </span>; sts. with another <span class=\"lex-gram\">part.</span>, <span class=\"gk\">τὴν τυραννίδα χαλεπὴν τελευτῶσαν γενομένην</span> having <b class=\"lex-tr\">at last</b> become.., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.53</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Phdr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">228b</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">πόλεις ἐπάγοντες καὶ τελευτῶντες Λακεδαιμονίους</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Lys.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">12.60</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">5</span> of local limits and the <abbr>like</abbr>, 